#ASSERT `Which section of the Wage Theft Amendment Act 2025 repealed it` `s 66` EQUALS 22
#ASSERT `Which section of the Wage Theft Amendment Act 2025 repealed it` `s 67` EQUALS 23
#ASSERT `Which section of the Wage Theft Amendment Act 2025 repealed it` `s 68` EQUALS 24
#ASSERT `Which section of the Wage Theft Amendment Act 2025 repealed it` `s 69` EQUALS 25
